WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:21,240
This one I've lost all my desire to eat not sure what to do. So when we lose our desire to eat and or we find ourselves losing weight and we can't keep weight on.

00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:33,240
That is typically a sign of cakexia. The definition of cakexia is when you're losing two to four pounds a week no matter what you eat you can't keep your weight on you just keep losing weight.

00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:57,240
So cakexia is a phenomena in chronic illness and cancer and there's no perfect definition of why physiologically that it takes place I wrote a blog post about this so go to the blog section here right there search cakexia in the blog post and I have a video even on that blog.

00:00:57,240 --> 00:01:13,240
There's a picture of the video and it's took a screenshot of the blog post watch that video because I give a bunch of hints to deal with weight loss and when I lose my desire to eat we just have to eat you have to remember you're eating to live regardless of whether you feel hungry or not.

00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:30,240
So make sure you don't stop eating you can't get in a state where you're losing weight on a weekly basis that is very detrimental we don't want to get into that state so watch that video there's some different exercise you can do some different things that you can do that can be really helpful.

